      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand how contemplating the vastness of the universe and its ultimate fate can lead to feelings of insignificance. However, it's important to remember that our existence can still hold profound meaning to us and those around us. The choices you make, the relationships you build, and the actions you take all contribute to a legacy that matters beyond just the endless void. Seeking purpose within your own context can help battle the overwhelming cosmic perspective and reaffirm the importance of your individual journey.",
